  <Callout kind="remember">
    A tease is a brake, a hold and a creep, set per spin with
    <code>setAnticipation</code> after <code>spin()</code> and before
    <code>setResult()</code>. The default shape brakes to 30% and holds; a
    curve lets you script the braking; stagger and slowdown space out and
    deepen several teases; protect keeps a press from ending them. The creep
    only happens when the tease ran to its end.
  </Callout>
